                "reply_count": 46,
                "retweet_count": 60,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It\u2019s been 252 days now since these families last heard the voices of their loved ones. \n\nMy heart breaks for them. How would you even sleep knowing the person you love is in captivity? I can tell you, after meeting with so many of their friends and families, they don\u2019t. I won\u2019t stop fighting until we bring every last American and Israeli home. @POTUS must be clear that he will do the same.",
