                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Every moment the Biden-Harris admin is silent, without any strong response, is a minute Maduro and his thugs are killing and brutally repressing the people of Venezuela. \n\nThe United States must stand firmly with the people of Venezuela as they exercise their political will.",
