                "retweet_count": 15,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Stop what you're doing and read this. \n\nThese families can't sleep. They can\u2019t stop thinking about their loved ones who\u2019ve been held hostage by Hamas terrorists for 347 days. \n\nWe will never understand what they\u2019re going through, but we must join together in demanding every hostage is brought home.",
