                "retweet_count": 21,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Liri and many other Americans and Israelis have been held hostage by Iran-backed Hamas terrorists for 349 days. \n\nBut for their families and friends, not a day has gone by because they can\u2019t sleep, can\u2019t eat, can\u2019t do anything without knowing the person they love is still in the hands of monsters. Enough is enough. We must bring them all home!",
