                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I can\u2019t imagine if this little boy was one of my grandsons. We wouldn\u2019t be able to sleep at night knowing it\u2019s been 377 days since they were kidnapped by Iran-backed Hamas terrorists. \n\nWe can\u2019t forget the Bibas family and every hostage. We must bring them all home!",
