                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, I met with families of hostages and former hostages held in tunnels by Hamas terrorists. \n\nTheir stories are heartbreaking and unimaginable. Former hostage Doron Steinbrecher told me about having to sleep by grenades and being forced to wash dishes for so many hours in a day that she no longer has fingerprints. No one should have to experience that abuse.\n\nIt\u2019s been 586 days now. We must BRING THEM ALL HOME.",
